1
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:51,590
Asgard's Serpent died with a deafening roar. The overpowering danger had been averted. Together, we had achieved what the gods had been unable to accomplish. We had won!

2
00:00:51,590 --> 00:01:06,990
The gates of Asgard reopened. A golden light streamed from the fortress and penetrated the Serpent's eternal night. The shadow that had already begun to cover the world dispersed, and all that had withered and been poisoned was now blossoming.

3
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:15,030
For a moment, the four great cultures of the West had come a little closer and united to ward off the downfall of the world.

4
00:01:15,330 --> 00:01:19,810
Only the future would show what our newfound friendships would bring.
